	(text "A0-A7, A9-A12 and D0-D7 are the console's; SRAM A8 = A8 & !A8MASK (glue sheet);\nA13-A18 are the RP's slot lines (GPIO32-37), the 8K page for the slot A13-A15 selects.\n/CE is tied active: /OE and /WE alone decide when the SRAM answers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
